# ── Provisioning ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
@Given "^an event created via api$"
    Given build json request with body from test data 'event-create' as user 'maker@example.com'
    When post to path '/events/create'
    Then response status code is '201'
    And store response field 'data.id' as 'eventId'

@Given "^the event is deleted via api$"
    Given build json request with path parameter 'id' from stored variable 'eventId' as user 'maker@example.com'
    When post to path '/events/{id}/delete'
    Then response status code is '200'
